                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'h4': 'How the figures follow',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'ol': [
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**2023** — a loss year. There is no profit to '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'relieve the loss against, so the whole '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**N80,000** is carried forward, and the year\'s '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**N5,000** capital allowance is likewise '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'unutilised and carried forward. Total profit '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'is nil, so **no CIT and no tertiary education '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'tax** arise — the education tax is charged on '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**assessable profit**, and there is none.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**2024** — the adjusted profit of N40,000 is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**entirely absorbed** by the N80,000 loss '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'brought forward, leaving **N40,000** of loss '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'still to carry forward. Because total profit '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'is nil, the capital allowances are again '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'unutilised and accumulate to **N8,500**. CIT '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'is nil, **but tertiary education tax is still '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'payable** — 2.5% × N40,000 = **N1,000**.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**2025** — the same pattern: N20,000 of profit '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'against N40,000 of loss leaves **N20,000** to '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'carry forward; capital allowances accumulate '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'to **N11,200**; CIT nil; education tax 3% × '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'N20,000 = **N600**.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**2026** — the recovery year. N50,000 of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'adjusted profit absorbs the last **N20,000** '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'of loss, leaving **N30,000**, against which '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'the whole accumulated capital allowance of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'N2,500 + N11,200 = **N13,700** is set, giving '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'a total profit of **N16,300**. CIT = 30% × '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'N16,300 = **N4,890**; education tax = 3% × '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'N50,000 = **N1,500**.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ],
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'key': 'The single most important feature of this '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'answer is that **tertiary education tax is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'payable in years when companies income tax is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'not**. CIT is charged on **total profit** — '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'after loss relief and capital allowances — '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'which is nil in 2024 and 2025. Education tax is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'charged on **assessable profit** — before both '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '— so it is payable on the full N40,000 and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'N20,000. A company with brought-forward losses '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'large enough to wipe out its CIT still writes a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'cheque for education tax.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'note': 'Note also that **capital allowances cannot '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'create or increase a loss**. They are set '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'against profit only, so in each nil-profit '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'year the allowance is carried forward in full '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'rather than deducted. By 2026 four years of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'allowances have accumulated to N13,700, and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'because that is less than the N30,000 of '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'profit available, all of it is absorbed at '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'once. Had the accumulated allowance exceeded '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'the profit, the excess would have carried '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'forward again.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'note': 'The **turnover of N101,300,000** is given for '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'a reason: it is **above the N100,000,000 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'small-company threshold**, so ZORO is **not** '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'exempt from companies income tax and the 30% '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'rate applies. Had turnover been N100,000,000 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'or less, the company would have been exempt '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'and — as Question 3 of Chapter 16 shows — its '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'capital allowances would have been **deemed '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'utilised** rather than carried forward.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'warn': 'Two presentational slips in the book\'s printed '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'solution, flagged rather than silently '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'corrected. **(1)** The 2024 line reading '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             '"**Utilised** capital allowance c/f 8,500" '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'should read **unutilised** — nothing was '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'utilised that year, as the nil total profit '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'shows. **(2)** The tertiary education tax is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'applied at **2.5%** in 2024 but at **3%** in '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             '2025 and 2026. The rate was increased to 3%, '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'so the change is not in itself an error, but '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'the book does not say when the increase takes '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'effect; if an examination question does not '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'state the rate, state the rate you are using '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'and why.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
